Dialogue: 0,0:00:40.67,0:00:47.41,Jungle P lyrics,,0,0,0,,Doesn't it sound fun just thinking about it?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:40.86,0:00:44.07,Credits,,0,0,0,,{\fad(50,0)}{\pos(764,480)}Soundtracking\N{\fs40}Halee
Dialogue: 0,0:00:44.24,0:00:47.41,Credits,,0,0,0,,{\pos(770,538)}Raw provider\N{\fs40}SOFCJ-Raws
Dialogue: 0,0:00:47.72,0:00:51.83,Jungle P lyrics,,0,0,0,,Let's travel all through the worldwide seas,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:51.91,0:00:54.16,Jungle P lyrics,,0,0,0,,raising our battle cry.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:54.29,0:00:58.50,Jungle P lyrics,,0,0,0,,If you've made up your mind, let the signal for departure
Dialogue: 0,0:00:58.67,0:01:00.92,Jungle P lyrics,,0,0,0,,ring out.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:08.34,0:01:11.51,Jungle P lyrics,,0,0,0,,That feeling we had when we set sail
Dialogue: 0,0:01:11.62,0:01:15.02,Jungle P lyrics,,0,0,0,,is something I'll never forget.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:15.16,0:01:16.81,Jungle P lyrics,,0,0,0,,Because of that
Dialogue: 0,0:01:16.98,0:01:20.48,Jungle P lyrics,,0,0,0,,nothing will be able to scare me...
Dialogue: 0,0:01:20.75,0:01:26.74,Jungle P lyrics,,0,0,0,,Now, as the trip approaches, our racing heartbeats
Dialogue: 0,0:01:26.93,0:01:33.66,Jungle P lyrics,,0,0,0,,engrave a rhythm of adventure in our shy hearts.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:33.87,0:01:38.06,Jungle P lyrics,,0,0,0,,{\fad(0,50)}Get all the treasures
Dialogue: 0,0:01:38.14,0:01:40.38,Jungle P lyrics,,0,0,0,,while laughing out loud.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:40.46,0:01:44.76,Jungle P lyrics,,0,0,0,,Give them all out at a big party
Dialogue: 0,0:01:44.82,0:01:47.40,Jungle P lyrics,,0,0,0,,{\fad(50,50)}making a splash...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:00.52,0:02:04.61,Jungle P lyrics,,0,0,0,,Fill your empty heart with dreams.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:04.71,0:02:06.94,Jungle P lyrics,,0,0,0,,Spread your wings.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:07.17,0:02:11.28,Jungle P lyrics,,0,0,0,,If you color your heart with the blowing wind
Dialogue: 0,0:02:11.37,0:02:13.61,Jungle P lyrics,,0,0,0,,you will move on.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:13.61,0:02:17.79,Jungle P lyrics,,0,0,0,,{\fad(50,0)}Get all the treasures
Dialogue: 0,0:02:17.96,0:02:20.12,Jungle P lyrics,,0,0,0,,while laughing out loud.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:20.25,0:02:24.48,Jungle P lyrics,,0,0,0,,Give them all out at a big party
Dialogue: 0,0:02:24.67,0:02:27.26,Jungle P lyrics,,0,0,0,,making a splash...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:29.83,0:02:38.59,Title,,0,0,100,,{\an8\fad(2000,2000)}被偷走的夢想！香吉士VS乂布薩羅姆
Dialogue: 0,0:02:42.03,0:02:43.79,Main,Luffy,0,0,0,,怎、怎麼回事？
Dialogue: 0,0:02:43.79,0:02:45.72,Main,Luffy,0,0,0,,好猛烈的震動！
Dialogue: 0,0:02:46.77,0:02:51.78,Main,Moriah,0,0,0,,船可能被捲進了什麼奇怪的水流裡...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:51.78,0:02:55.37,Main,Moriah,0,0,0,,大概是你的錯吧。
Dialogue: 0,0:02:59.22,0:03:02.84,Main,Moria,0,0,0,,那麼，你來這裡有什麼事？
Dialogue: 0,0:03:02.84,0:03:04.70,Main,Moria,0,0,0,,你為什麼來的？
Dialogue: 0,0:03:04.70,0:03:09.66,Main,Luffy,0,0,0,,嗯，你之前搶走了我的影子。
Dialogue: 0,0:03:11.02,0:03:13.09,Main,Luffy,0,0,0,,我要拿回來。
Dialogue: 0,0:03:13.09,0:03:14.02,Main,Luffy,0,0,0,,還有索隆的、
Dialogue: 0,0:03:14.02,0:03:15.10,Main,Luffy,0,0,0,,香吉士的、
Dialogue: 0,0:03:15.10,0:03:15.86,Main,Luffy,0,0,0,,布魯克的、
Dialogue: 0,0:03:15.86,0:03:17.32,Main,Luffy,0,0,0,,還有那個殭屍老頭的。
Dialogue: 0,0:03:17.32,0:03:18.42,Main,Luffy,0,0,0,,全部！
Dialogue: 0,0:03:19.44,0:03:21.95,Main,Moriah,0,0,0,,真是個貪心的傢伙。
Dialogue: 0,0:03:21.95,0:03:24.12,Main,Moriah,0,0,0,,那你打算怎麼做？
Dialogue: 0,0:03:27.16,0:03:29.10,Main,Luffy,0,0,0,,我會揍飛你！
Dialogue: 0,0:03:33.50,0:03:35.73,Main,Moriah,0,0,0,,揍飛我？
Dialogue: 0,0:03:35.73,0:03:37.69,Main,Luffy,0,0,0,,沒錯。
Dialogue: 0,0:03:37.69,0:03:44.32,Main,Moriah,0,0,0,,就算你打敗我或殺了我，殭屍們只是失去主人而已。
Dialogue: 0,0:03:44.32,0:03:46.43,Main,Moriah,0,0,0,,影子不會跑出來的。
Dialogue: 0,0:03:47.68,0:03:51.31,Main,Moria,0,0,0,,我的惡魔果實能力是支配影子。
Dialogue: 0,0:03:51.31,0:03:55.67,Main,Moria,0,0,0,,想要你的願望實現的話，方法是這樣的...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:56.09,0:04:04.54,Main,Moria,0,0,0,,影子現在的主人必須聽到我下令「回到你的主人身邊」。
Dialogue: 0,0:04:04.54,0:04:07.01,Main,Luffy,0,0,0,,光那樣做就能讓所有影子回去？
Dialogue: 0,0:04:08.54,0:04:10.52,Main,Moriah,0,0,0,,沒錯！很簡單吧？
Dialogue: 0,0:04:10.52,0:04:14.61,Main,Moriah,0,0,0,,你可以削弱我到那種程度，但...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:14.61,0:04:20.37,Main,Moriah,0,0,0,,以你現在的實力，我很懷疑你是否能碰到我。
Dialogue: 0,0:04:24.64,0:04:26.01,Main,Luffy,0,0,0,,好吧。
Dialogue: 0,0:04:26.18,0:04:28.08,Main,Luffy,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)}橡膠...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:29.29,0:04:30.18,Main,Luffy,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)}手槍！
Dialogue: 0,0:04:35.02,0:04:36.50,Main,Luffy,0,0,0,,影子？
Dialogue: 0,0:04:40.59,0:04:42.21,Main,Moriah,0,0,0,,來試試看你能不能贏...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:42.88,0:04:44.50,Main,Moriah,0,0,0,,贏過我的分身，
Dialogue: 0,0:04:44.50,0:04:46.22,Main,Moriah,0,0,0,,影法師！
Dialogue: 0,0:04:51.27,0:04:56.99,Main,Moriah,0,0,0,,很久以前，我也曾對自己的能力和野心過於自信。
Dialogue: 0,0:04:56.99,0:05:01.50,Main,Moriah,0,0,0,,直到我終於意識到需要更多的部下。
Dialogue: 0,0:05:01.50,0:05:03.39,Main,Luffy,0,0,0,,這傢伙是誰？
Dialogue: 0,0:05:03.39,0:05:04.61,Main,Luffy,0,0,0,,喂！讓開！
Dialogue: 0,0:05:06.57,0:05:09.60,Main,Moriah,0,0,0,,我連一根手指都不必動。
Dialogue: 0,0:05:09.60,0:05:13.20,Main,Moria,0,0,0,,別人的努力會讓我成為海賊王。
Dialogue: 0,0:05:15.81,0:05:17.46,Main,Luffy,0,0,0,,我會成為海賊王！
Dialogue: 0,0:05:17.90,0:05:20.48,Main,Moriah,0,0,0,,你的殭屍也說了同樣的話。
Dialogue: 0,0:05:21.44,0:05:27.05,Flashbacks,Oars,0,0,0,,我會成為海賊王！
Dialogue: 0,0:05:28.80,0:05:33.34,Main,Moriah,0,0,0,,不愧是同樣的影子和身體。儘管體型不同，
Dialogue: 0,0:05:33.34,0:05:36.58,Main,Moriah,0,0,0,,他依然反映了原主人的堅強意志。
Dialogue: 0,0:05:38.44,0:05:41.45,Main,Moriah,0,0,0,,但這不會持續太久。
Dialogue: 0,0:05:42.36,0:05:49.49,Main,Moriah,0,0,0,,一旦他失去了所有身為你的記憶，他就會完全成為我忠誠的殭屍。
Dialogue: 0,0:05:49.49,0:05:55.95,Main,Moriah,0,0,0,,不管意志有多堅強，每個殭屍最終都會展現出絕對的忠誠！
Dialogue: 0,0:05:57.33,0:05:58.85,Main,Luffy,0,0,0,,我現在就要拿回來！
Dialogue: 0,0:05:59.79,0:06:01.71,Main,Luffy,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)}橡膠...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:01.71,0:06:03.19,Main,Moria,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)}磚塊蝙蝠！
Dialogue: 0,0:06:03.19,0:06:04.78,Main,Luffy,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)}機關槍！
Dialogue: 0,0:06:07.26,0:06:09.59,Main,Luffy,0,0,0,,可惡！牠們在保護他！
Dialogue: 0,0:06:09.59,0:06:10.76,Main,Luffy,0,0,0,,我打不到他！
Dialogue: 0,0:06:20.40,0:06:23.61,Main,Moriah,0,0,0,,別擔心，牠們不會吸你的血。
Dialogue: 0,0:06:23.88,0:06:25.96,Main,Moriah,0,0,0,,揍飛我？
Dialogue: 0,0:06:25.96,0:06:27.15,Main,Moriah,0,0,0,,別讓我笑了。
Dialogue: 0,0:06:27.60,0:06:29.07,Main,Luffy,0,0,0,,放開我！
Dialogue: 0,0:06:36.66,0:06:42.58,Main,Moriah,0,0,0,,沒經驗的年輕人總是小看所有人，最後被嘲笑。
Dialogue: 0,0:06:45.61,0:06:48.47,Main,Luffy,0,0,0,,你這混蛋！我受夠你了！
Dialogue: 0,0:06:49.46,0:06:51.14,Main,Luffy,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)}橡膠...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:52.16,0:06:54.45,Main,Moria,0,0,0,,什麼？他跳下去了...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:54.45,0:06:55.64,Main,Moria,0,0,0,,你要逃跑嗎？
Dialogue: 0,0:06:56.01,0:06:58.10,Main,Luffy,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)}印章！
Dialogue: 0,0:07:06.25,0:07:08.78,Main,Moriah,0,0,0,,好痛，臭小鬼！
Dialogue: 0,0:07:08.78,0:07:09.88,Main,Luffy,0,0,0,,看到了吧！
Dialogue: 0,0:07:09.88,0:07:12.70,Main,Luffy,0,0,0,,我果然碰到你了，大蔥頭！
Dialogue: 0,0:07:30.52,0:07:34.05,Main,Sanji,0,0,0,,蹦蹦蹦蹦蹦蹦...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:34.05,0:07:35.80,Main,Sanji,0,0,0,,把你的...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:36.16,0:07:38.10,Main,Sanji,0,0,0,,手從娜美小姐身上拿開！
Dialogue: 0,0:07:48.28,0:07:50.14,Main,Sanji,0,0,0,,抱歉讓你久等了，娜美小姐。
Dialogue: 0,0:07:51.06,0:07:52.36,Main,Sanji,0,0,0,,你的騎士來了。
Dialogue: 0,0:07:56.64,0:07:57.33,Main,Sanji,0,0,0,,這是...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:58.79,0:08:00.25,Main,Sanji,0,0,0,,女神嗎？
Dialogue: 0,0:08:02.56,0:08:04.56,Main,Sanji,0,0,0,,啊，不，是娜美小姐...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:04.56,0:08:06.00,Main,Sanji,0,0,0,,絕對是娜美小姐。
Dialogue: 0,0:08:06.00,0:08:07.77,Main,Sanji,0,0,0,,毫無疑問。
Dialogue: 0,0:08:07.77,0:08:09.71,Main,Sanji,0,0,0,,啊，嚇了我一跳...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:09.71,0:08:11.86,Main,Sanji,0,0,0,,如此的美貌很容易讓人搞混。
Dialogue: 0,0:08:11.86,0:08:15.19,Main,Sanji,0,0,0,,我一瞬間還以為自己不小心救了一位仙女。
Dialogue: 0,0:08:12.95,0:08:14.10,Secondary,Absalom,0,0,0,,真是的...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:14.10,0:08:16.67,Secondary,Absalom,0,0,0,,你在胡說什麼啊？
Dialogue: 0,0:08:16.67,0:08:20.46,Main,Absalom,0,0,0,,你是留在船上的船員之一吧？
Dialogue: 0,0:08:23.97,0:08:25.68,Main,Absalom,0,0,0,,天、天使?！
Dialogue: 0,0:08:28.31,0:08:31.37,Main,Absalom,0,0,0,,啊，不不，是人類。
Dialogue: 0,0:08:31.37,0:08:32.47,Main,Absalom,0,0,0,,毫無疑問。
Dialogue: 0,0:08:32.47,0:08:34.65,Main,Absalom,0,0,0,,嚇到我了。
Dialogue: 0,0:08:35.60,0:08:36.81,Main,Sanji,0,0,0,,我不怪你。
Dialogue: 0,0:08:36.81,0:08:38.70,Main,Sanji,0,0,0,,一點都不怪你。
Dialogue: 0,0:08:38.70,0:08:42.09,Main,Sanji,0,0,0,,看到娜美小姐穿著這雪白的衣服確實會讓人搞混。
Dialogue: 0,0:08:42.09,0:08:43.65,Main,Absalom,0,0,0,,完全正確！
Dialogue: 0,0:08:43.65,0:08:45.69,Main,Zombie,0,0,0,,那兩個人怎麼回事？
Dialogue: 0,0:08:44.70,0:08:45.69,Secondary,Absalom,0,0,0,,我們想到一塊去了。
Dialogue: 0,0:08:46.56,0:08:47.86,Main,Absalom,0,0,0,,可惡的海賊！
Dialogue: 0,0:08:47.86,0:08:49.88,Main,Absalom,0,0,0,,我沒有理由跟你合得來！
Dialogue: 0,0:08:56.06,0:08:56.95,Main,Sanji,0,0,0,,喂！
Dialogue: 0,0:08:58.60,0:09:01.12,Main,Sanji,0,0,0,,差點打到娜美小姐了。
Dialogue: 0,0:09:01.12,0:09:05.21,Main,Sanji,0,0,0,,在女性面前你不應該魯莽攻擊。
Dialogue: 0,0:09:05.70,0:09:07.90,Main,Absalom,0,0,0,,閃得好。
Dialogue: 0,0:09:07.90,0:09:09.86,Main,Absalom,0,0,0,,看來你也失去了影子。
Dialogue: 0,0:09:09.86,0:09:14.82,Main,Absalom,0,0,0,,說起來，有個新來的殭屍對那個女人有著奇怪的執著。
Dialogue: 0,0:09:15.54,0:09:19.87,Main,Absalom,0,0,0,,一個還殘留著一點自我的叛逆殭屍。
Dialogue: 0,0:09:20.21,0:09:23.16,Main,Absalom,0,0,0,,那大概就是你的殭屍吧。
Dialogue: 0,0:09:23.16,0:09:30.21,Main,Absalom,0,0,0,,他沒有被列入將軍殭屍的事實，代表他的本體很弱。
Dialogue: 0,0:09:30.66,0:09:34.09,Main,Absalom,0,0,0,,那個自大的企鵝其實相當弱。
Dialogue: 0,0:09:34.61,0:09:36.05,Main,Absalom,0,0,0,,簡直荒謬...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:36.05,0:09:41.01,Main,Absalom,0,0,0,,一個可悲的嘍囉竟然來找我這個怪物和將軍殭屍的指揮官挑釁！
Dialogue: 0,0:09:41.55,0:09:42.88,Main,Sanji,0,0,0,,水、水妖精？！
Dialogue: 0,0:09:45.56,0:09:47.66,Main,Sanji,0,0,0,,嚇到我了...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:47.66,0:09:49.74,Main,Sanji,0,0,0,,我以為那一瞬間看到了水妖精。
Dialogue: 0,0:09:49.74,0:09:52.27,Main,Absalom,0,0,0,,好了，我不想動粗...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:52.27,0:09:54.68,Main,Absalom,0,0,0,,把那個女人留給我，你就回去過你的影子生活吧。
Dialogue: 0,0:09:54.68,0:09:57.49,Main,Absalom,0,0,0,,我現在很忙...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:57.49,0:10:04.81,Main,Absalom,0,0,0,,我最強的部下被你那白癡船長的殭屍消滅了。
Dialogue: 0,0:10:04.81,0:10:09.58,Main,Absalom,0,0,0,,在那之前，我連對新娘的宣誓之吻都沒能完成...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:09.93,0:10:11.34,Main,Absalom,0,0,0,,你懂了吧？
Dialogue: 0,0:10:11.34,0:10:13.53,Main,Absalom,0,0,0,,我現在非常煩躁。
Dialogue: 0,0:10:14.61,0:10:16.97,Main,Absalom,0,0,0,,我沒時間對付你這種業餘-
Dialogue: 0,0:10:18.09,0:10:21.37,Main,Sanji,0,0,0,,閉嘴，你這個嘉年華獸面男！
Dialogue: 0,0:10:21.37,0:10:22.72,Main,Zombie,0,0,0,,乂布薩羅姆大人！
Dialogue: 0,0:10:22.72,0:10:23.49,Main,Zombie,0,0,0,,不可能！
Dialogue: 0,0:10:23.49,0:10:26.93,Main,Zombie,0,0,0,,他一瞬間就把那三百公斤的身體踢飛了！
Dialogue: 0,0:10:30.21,0:10:33.86,Main,Sanji,0,0,0,,你一定就是騙人布說的那個隱形人。
Dialogue: 0,0:10:33.86,0:10:35.99,Thoughts,Absalom,0,0,0,,那是什麼踢技？！
Dialogue: 0,0:10:35.99,0:10:41.11,Thoughts,Absalom,0,0,0,,乂乂乂克用野獸的力量改造了我的身體，他竟然還能把我踢飛...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:42.74,0:10:43.81,Main,Absalom,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)}亡者之手！
Dialogue: 0,0:10:46.96,0:10:48.32,Thoughts,Absalom,0,0,0,,這是怎麼回事？！
Dialogue: 0,0:10:48.32,0:10:50.83,Thoughts,Absalom,0,0,0,,他知道我要做什麼？！
Dialogue: 0,0:10:52.17,0:10:53.53,Main,Sanji,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)}上等肋排！
Dialogue: 0,0:10:52.17,0:10:53.53,Note,Sanji,0,0,100,,{\fad(150,150)}下肋
Dialogue: 0,0:10:54.83,0:10:56.28,Main,Sanji,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)}後腰肉！
Dialogue: 0,0:10:54.83,0:10:56.28,Note,Sanji,0,0,100,,{\fad(150,150)}腰肉
Dialogue: 0,0:10:56.28,0:11:00.40,Main,Sanji,0,0,0,,你就是在千陽號上舔了羅賓醬的那個野獸吧？！
Dialogue: 0,0:11:01.01,0:11:02.65,Flashbacks,Robin,0,0,0,,有什麼東西抓住我了...！
Dialogue: 0,0:11:03.68,0:11:06.95,Main,Sanji,0,0,0,,你就是在浴室裡看到娜美小姐全身赤裸的傢伙吧？
Dialogue: 0,0:11:07.78,0:11:10.25,Flashbacks,Absalom,0,0,0,,你會成為我的新娘。
Dialogue: 0,0:11:10.50,0:11:11.62,Main,Sanji,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)}胸腹肉！
Dialogue: 0,0:11:10.50,0:11:11.62,Note,Sanji,0,0,100,,{\fad(150,150)}頸肉
Dialogue: 0,0:11:11.62,0:11:12.45,Main,Sanji,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)}側腹肉！
Dialogue: 0,0:11:11.62,0:11:12.45,Note,,0,0,100,,{\fad(150,150)}腹部
Dialogue: 0,0:11:12.58,0:11:13.36,Main,Sanji,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)}臀肉！
Dialogue: 0,0:11:12.58,0:11:13.36,Note,Sanji,0,0,100,,{\fad(150,150)}臀部
Dialogue: 0,0:11:14.20,0:11:15.69,Thoughts,Absalom,0,0,0,,他的力量是怎麼回事？！
Dialogue: 0,0:11:15.69,0:11:16.96,Thoughts,Absalom,0,0,0,,他真的只是個小嘍囉？！
Dialogue: 0,0:11:17.18,0:11:18.09,Main,Sanji,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)}尾肉！
Dialogue: 0,0:11:17.18,0:11:18.09,Note,Sanji,0,0,100,,{\fad(150,150)}尾部
Dialogue: 0,0:11:18.09,0:11:18.98,Main,Sanji,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)}後腿肉！
Dialogue: 0,0:11:18.09,0:11:18.98,Note,Sanji,0,0,100,,{\fad(150,150)}大腿
Dialogue: 0,0:11:18.98,0:11:19.63,Main,Sanji,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)}小腿肉！
Dialogue: 0,0:11:18.98,0:11:19.63,Note,Sanji,0,0,100,,{\fad(150,150)}小腿
Dialogue: 0,0:11:19.63,0:11:21.84,Main,Sanji,0,0,0,,她為什麼昏迷了？！
Dialogue: 0,0:11:21.84,0:11:24.38,Main,Sanji,0,0,0,,你最好沒有對她動粗！
Dialogue: 0,0:11:28.08,0:11:29.57,Main,Sanji,0,0,0,,什麼結婚？！
Dialogue: 0,0:11:29.57,0:11:33.33,Main,Sanji,0,0,0,,看著我的眼睛！我會把你踢到不成人形，然後用你的殘骸做可樂餅！
Dialogue: 0,0:11:34.02,0:11:35.72,Main,Absalom,0,0,0,,可惡！得躲開他！
Dialogue: 0,0:11:35.72,0:11:36.87,Main,Absalom,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)}溜冰...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:37.92,0:11:40.18,Main,Sanji,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)}騙人布的特製鹽球...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:43.72,0:11:45.03,Thoughts,Sanji,0,0,0,,他在那裡！
Dialogue: 0,0:11:45.74,0:11:47.06,Main,Absalom,0,0,0,,什麼？！好鹹！
Dialogue: 0,0:11:48.52,0:11:51.05,Note,Sanji,0,0,100,,{\fad(150,150)}小牛肉射擊
Dialogue: 0,0:11:48.52,0:11:51.05,Main,Sanji,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)}小牛肉射擊！
Dialogue: 0,0:11:57.31,0:11:58.55,Thoughts,Absalom,0,0,0,,不可能...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:58.55,0:12:02.53,Thoughts,Absalom,0,0,0,,這傢伙明明連懸賞金都沒有...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:03.28,0:12:05.63,Main,Sanji,0,0,0,,你說你很煩躁...？
Dialogue: 0,0:12:06.39,0:12:08.70,Main,Sanji,0,0,0,,跟我比起來根本不算什麼...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:09.19,0:12:11.95,Main,Sanji,0,0,0,,我的身體快被怒火燒爆了！
Dialogue: 0,0:12:13.60,0:12:15.06,Main,Zombie,0,0,0,,沒錯！
Dialogue: 0,0:12:17.35,0:12:21.94,Main,Sanji,0,0,0,,而且還有一件更不幸的事...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:21.94,0:12:24.51,Main,Sanji,0,0,0,,你跟我之間...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:24.51,0:12:26.43,Main,Sanji,0,0,0,,有因緣！
Dialogue: 0,0:12:35.67,0:12:37.77,Main,Zombie,0,0,0,,乂、乂布薩羅姆大人...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:39.04,0:12:43.03,Main,Absalom,0,0,0,,你跟我有因緣？
Dialogue: 0,0:12:44.87,0:12:50.91,Main,Sanji,0,0,0,,沒錯，你就是偷走我夢想的人。
Dialogue: 0,0:12:55.48,0:12:56.88,Main,Absalom,0,0,0,,我不記得你。
Dialogue: 0,0:12:56.88,0:12:58.74,Main,Absalom,0,0,0,,一定是什麼誤會。
Dialogue: 0,0:12:58.74,0:13:00.34,Main,Absalom,0,0,0,,今天是第一次...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:02.18,0:13:04.59,Main,Absalom,0,0,0,,我跟你碰面。
Dialogue: 0,0:13:06.91,0:13:08.37,Main,Absalom,0,0,0,,我把你轟飛！
Dialogue: 0,0:13:09.86,0:13:12.18,Main,Absalom,0,0,0,,用這個亡者之手！
Dialogue: 0,0:13:14.46,0:13:16.48,Main,Sanji,0,0,0,,拿掉。
Dialogue: 0,0:13:18.18,0:13:21.90,Main,Sanji,0,0,0,,我叫你拿掉裝在手臂上的火箭炮。
Dialogue: 0,0:13:24.26,0:13:25.96,Main,Sanji,0,0,0,,你聽不懂嗎？
Dialogue: 0,0:13:27.22,0:13:35.00,Main,Sanji,0,0,0,,如果娜美小姐因為你的胡亂攻擊而受傷，等我收拾完你的時候你就不會像活人了。
Dialogue: 0,0:13:36.02,0:13:37.67,Main,Absalom,0,0,0,,他什麼都不知道...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:40.57,0:13:41.94,Main,Sanji,0,0,0,,我叫你...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:43.23,0:13:45.17,Main,Sanji,0,0,0,,拿掉！
Dialogue: 0,0:13:53.06,0:13:56.06,Main,Zombie,0,0,0,,什麼？！突然冒出一個火箭炮！
Dialogue: 0,0:13:56.40,0:13:58.26,Main,Sanji,0,0,0,,是那樣的對吧？
Dialogue: 0,0:13:58.26,0:14:00.94,Main,Sanji,0,0,0,,真是個聰明的攻擊手段。
Dialogue: 0,0:14:01.40,0:14:07.33,Main,Sanji,0,0,0,,你讓自己的身體隱形，而任何跟你身體接觸的東西也會隱形。
Dialogue: 0,0:14:07.33,0:14:09.86,Main,Sanji,0,0,0,,那就是你的能力...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:09.86,0:14:11.95,Main,Sanji,0,0,0,,透明果實的隱形人。
Dialogue: 0,0:14:12.49,0:14:15.83,Main,Sanji,0,0,0,,你能做什麼我全都知道！
Dialogue: 0,0:14:16.40,0:14:17.73,Main,Absalom,0,0,0,,怎麼可能...？！
Dialogue: 0,0:14:17.73,0:14:19.29,Main,Absalom,0,0,0,,你到底是誰...？！
Dialogue: 0,0:14:19.61,0:14:23.22,Main,Zombie,0,0,0,,那個男人以前見過乂布薩羅姆大人嗎？
Dialogue: 0,0:14:23.22,0:14:25.30,Main,Zombie,0,0,0,,他怎麼會對他的能力瞭若指掌？
Dialogue: 0,0:14:26.84,0:14:30.47,Main,Sanji,0,0,0,,我小時候，看過一本關於惡魔果實的大型圖鑑。
Dialogue: 0,0:14:30.93,0:14:36.10,Main,Sanji,0,0,0,,一開始，我對那些海洋詛咒的傳聞沒什麼興趣，但是...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:36.59,0:14:41.14,Main,Sanji,0,0,0,,翻著翻著，我看到了一樣吸引我目光的東西。
Dialogue: 0,0:14:41.14,0:14:44.64,Main,Sanji,0,0,0,,如果我能找到那個能力的話...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:44.64,0:14:47.57,Main,Sanji,0,0,0,,就算會被詛咒，我也甘願吃下去！
Dialogue: 0,0:14:48.74,0:14:53.12,Main,Sanji,0,0,0,,但這世上不存在兩顆相同的果實。
Dialogue: 0,0:14:55.21,0:15:00.48,Main,Sanji,0,0,0,,萬一我碰到了那顆果實的能力者，我的夢想就完了！
Dialogue: 0,0:15:00.48,0:15:02.19,Main,Sanji,0,0,0,,你懂了吧？！
Dialogue: 0,0:15:02.19,0:15:05.73,Main,Sanji,0,0,0,,我想成為隱形人！
Dialogue: 0,0:15:06.32,0:15:12.20,Main,Sanji,0,0,0,,所以，在你吃下透明果實的瞬間，\N你就粉碎了我的夢想！
Dialogue: 0,0:15:12.20,0:15:14.53,Main,Zombie,0,0,0,,他說得對！
Dialogue: 0,0:15:14.78,0:15:17.11,Main,Sanji,0,0,0,,我希望我的夢想能實現！
Dialogue: 0,0:15:17.11,0:15:19.41,Main,Sanji,0,0,0,,如果有了那個能力的話，我就能進入...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:19.41,0:15:20.29,Main,Sanji,0,0,0,,女澡堂！
Dialogue: 0,0:15:20.29,0:15:23.04,Main,Sanji,0,0,0,,不，我要做的是在...光明正大地...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:23.04,0:15:24.02,Main,Sanji,0,0,0,,女澡堂！
Dialogue: 0,0:15:24.02,0:15:27.17,Main,Sanji,0,0,0,,不，我一定會幫助在...的人們...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:27.17,0:15:28.23,Main,Sanji,0,0,0,,女澡堂！
Dialogue: 0,0:15:28.23,0:15:32.72,Main,Zombie,0,0,0,,他只想偷看女澡堂而已！
Dialogue: 0,0:15:32.72,0:15:34.30,Main,Sanji,0,0,0,,閉嘴！
Dialogue: 0,0:15:34.30,0:15:38.78,Main,Sanji,0,0,0,,但多虧多年的模擬訓練，你能看到的一切-
Dialogue: 0,0:15:38.78,0:15:42.77,Main,Sanji,0,0,0,,不，你用那個能力能做的一切我都知道！
Dialogue: 0,0:15:45.70,0:15:51.65,Main,Sanji,0,0,0,,再加上你讓娜美小姐陷入危險，我絕對不會原諒你！
Dialogue: 0,0:15:51.65,0:15:52.40,Main,Sanji,0,0,0,,女澡-
Dialogue: 0,0:15:52.40,0:15:55.39,Main,Sanji,0,0,0,,不！你做好覺悟吧！
Dialogue: 0,0:15:56.91,0:15:58.73,Main,Absalom,0,0,0,,你在想什麼啊？！
Dialogue: 0,0:15:58.73,0:16:01.60,Main,Absalom,0,0,0,,什麼莫名其妙的因緣！
Dialogue: 0,0:16:02.41,0:16:05.33,Main,Absalom,0,0,0,,我這輩子聽過最蠢的話！
Dialogue: 0,0:16:05.33,0:16:06.25,Main,Absalom,0,0,0,,你是個...！
Dialogue: 0,0:16:06.25,0:16:08.15,Main,Absalom,0,0,0,,超級大變態！
Dialogue: 0,0:16:08.78,0:16:09.73,Main,Sanji,0,0,0,,我不想...！
Dialogue: 0,0:16:10.55,0:16:12.51,Main,Sanji,0,0,0,,被你這麼說！
Dialogue: 0,0:16:12.51,0:16:14.39,Main,Zombie,0,0,0,,他說得對！
Dialogue: 0,0:16:15.76,0:16:18.66,Main,Zombie,0,0,0,,但他們是一樣的！
Dialogue: 0,0:16:18.66,0:16:21.83,Main,Absalom,0,0,0,,好吧！
Dialogue: 0,0:16:25.82,0:16:30.51,Main,Absalom,0,0,0,,我會把你的因緣、你的怒火，全部還給你！
Dialogue: 0,0:16:32.70,0:16:34.76,Main,Absalom,0,0,0,,我不僅有獅子的下顎...！
Dialogue: 0,0:16:35.31,0:16:36.57,Main,Absalom,0,0,0,,大象的皮膚...！
Dialogue: 0,0:16:38.57,0:16:42.23,Main,Absalom,0,0,0,,三百公斤濃縮的熊和猩猩肌肉！
Dialogue: 0,0:16:42.99,0:16:50.66,Main,Absalom,0,0,0,,一次又一次的移植，乂乂乂克醫生不斷改造我，直到我獲得了這具終極的傑作身體！
Dialogue: 0,0:16:50.66,0:16:54.68,Main,Absalom,0,0,0,,透明果實只不過是附加品而已。
Dialogue: 0,0:16:54.68,0:16:58.58,Main,Absalom,0,0,0,,跟我所擁有的可怕力量根本無法相比！
Dialogue: 0,0:16:58.58,0:17:00.04,Main,Absalom,0,0,0,,你現在懂了吧？
Dialogue: 0,0:17:02.04,0:17:03.14,Main,Sanji,0,0,0,,但是...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:03.14,0:17:05.05,Main,Sanji,0,0,0,,你還是偷看了！
Dialogue: 0,0:17:07.96,0:17:09.71,Main,Zombie,0,0,0,,確實是！
Dialogue: 0,0:17:13.05,0:17:18.09,Thoughts,Absalom,0,0,0,,如果是普通的踢擊，他的腿早就碎了...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:18.42,0:17:22.18,Thoughts,Absalom,0,0,0,,對他來說，就像我的身體只是個普通人的身體一樣。
Dialogue: 0,0:17:22.51,0:17:26.69,Main,Absalom,0,0,0,,但最後笑的會是我！
Dialogue: 0,0:17:29.92,0:17:36.49,Main,Absalom,0,0,0,,你失去了你渴望的能力，現在連你想保護的女人也會成為我的新娘！
Dialogue: 0,0:17:36.49,0:17:38.93,Main,Absalom,0,0,0,,你在這種狀態下根本沒機會打敗我！
Dialogue: 0,0:17:41.24,0:17:46.41,Flashbacks,Usopp,0,0,0,,那時候，娜美跟他一起消失了，我們追不上去！
Dialogue: 0,0:17:47.61,0:17:49.21,Main,Sanji,0,0,0,,你想藏起娜美小姐對吧？！
Dialogue: 0,0:17:49.21,0:17:50.41,Main,Sanji,0,0,0,,除非我死！
Dialogue: 0,0:17:55.56,0:17:56.77,Main,Absalom,0,0,0,,沒用的！
Dialogue: 0,0:17:56.77,0:18:00.72,Main,Absalom,0,0,0,,讓你見識一下獸人的力量！
Dialogue: 0,0:18:06.32,0:18:09.65,Main,Absalom,0,0,0,,所以你打算為了那個女人犧牲自己？
Dialogue: 0,0:18:11.24,0:18:12.55,Main,Absalom,0,0,0,,那就保護她吧！
Dialogue: 0,0:18:12.55,0:18:14.40,Main,Absalom,0,0,0,,如果你做得到的話！
Dialogue: 0,0:18:14.40,0:18:15.51,Main,Absalom,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)}獸人之手！
Dialogue: 0,0:18:15.51,0:18:17.07,Main,Absalom,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)}獸人之腳！
Dialogue: 0,0:18:27.79,0:18:30.65,Main,Absalom,0,0,0,,不要放開她！
Dialogue: 0,0:18:35.97,0:18:38.83,Main,Sanji,0,0,0,,對不起... 娜美小姐...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:44.89,0:18:46.04,Main,Absalom,0,0,0,,你放開她了？
Dialogue: 0,0:18:46.04,0:18:48.18,Main,Absalom,0,0,0,,看來你果然把自己的命看得比她重要！
Dialogue: 0,0:18:49.77,0:18:51.19,Main,Sanji,0,0,0,,抱歉...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:51.19,0:18:55.19,Main,Sanji,0,0,0,,我不想弄髒那件雪白的禮服...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:57.44,0:19:02.16,Main,Sanji,0,0,0,,可惡... 只會躲藏和偷偷摸摸的隱形人...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:02.16,0:19:05.66,Main,Sanji,0,0,0,,我已經不在乎那個夢想了...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:06.16,0:19:10.54,Main,Sanji,0,0,0,,我不再... 在乎成為隱形人了！
Dialogue: 0,0:19:11.23,0:19:12.86,Main,Sanji,0,0,0,,我會自己偷看！
Dialogue: 0,0:19:12.86,0:19:14.46,Main,Zombie,0,0,0,,你還想偷看？！
Dialogue: 0,0:19:20.76,0:19:22.04,Main,Absalom,0,0,0,,放開我，混蛋！
Dialogue: 0,0:19:22.94,0:19:23.90,Main,Absalom,0,0,0,,放開！
Dialogue: 0,0:19:26.08,0:19:27.97,Main,Sanji,0,0,0,,想都別想，你這骯髒的混蛋！
Dialogue: 0,0:19:29.83,0:19:32.67,Main,Sanji,0,0,0,,如果你是由多種野獸組成的...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:32.67,0:19:35.19,Main,Sanji,0,0,0,,那你剛好能做成上等的絞肉！
Dialogue: 0,0:19:36.21,0:19:39.82,Main,Absalom,0,0,0,,閉嘴！放開我！
Dialogue: 0,0:19:47.03,0:19:49.70,Main,Sanji,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)}特等肉末！
Dialogue: 0,0:19:47.03,0:19:49.70,Note,Sanji,0,0,100,,{\fad(150,150)}Haché：絞肉
Dialogue: 0,0:19:49.70,0:19:51.87,Main,Zombie,0,0,0,,乂布薩羅姆大人！
Dialogue: 0,0:19:58.18,0:19:59.46,Main,Sanji,0,0,0,,女澡堂...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:59.46,0:20:00.69,Main,Sanji,0,0,0,,不...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:00.69,0:20:02.93,Main,Sanji,0,0,0,,野獸的新娘...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:03.62,0:20:05.69,Main,Sanji,0,0,0,,應該是另一頭野獸。
Dialogue: 0,0:20:14.00,0:20:16.12,Main,Perona,0,0,0,,他還在追我！
Dialogue: 0,0:20:16.12,0:20:19.92,Main,Pelona,0,0,0,,要不是因為他，我早就打敗那些海賊了！
Dialogue: 0,0:20:19.92,0:20:21.65,Main,Pelona,0,0,0,,該死的消極鼻子！
Dialogue: 0,0:20:24.50,0:20:26.46,Main,Usopp,0,0,0,,他還在追我！
Dialogue: 0,0:20:26.46,0:20:30.93,Main,Usopp,0,0,0,,要不是因為他，我早就打敗那個虛空女了！
Dialogue: 0,0:20:30.93,0:20:32.39,Main,Usopp,0,0,0,,該死的熊殭屍！
Dialogue: 0,0:20:32.39,0:20:34.56,Main,Kumashi,0,0,0,,等一下...！
Dialogue: 0,0:20:35.43,0:20:36.48,Main,Usopp,0,0,0,,不要過來！
Dialogue: 0,0:20:36.48,0:20:38.00,Main,Usopp,0,0,0,,等一下，虛空女！
Dialogue: 0,0:20:38.65,0:20:39.98,Main,Perona,0,0,0,,不要過來！
Dialogue: 0,0:20:39.98,0:20:42.22,Main,Perona,0,0,0,,乂瑪西，快去攔住他！
Dialogue: 0,0:20:43.02,0:20:44.01,Main,Kumashi,0,0,0,,等一下...！
Dialogue: 0,0:20:45.01,0:20:49.25,Main,Kumashi,0,0,0,,不要碰乂洛娜大人...！
Dialogue: 0,0:20:50.01,0:20:52.75,Main,Usopp,0,0,0,,太近了！太近了！
Dialogue: 0,0:20:52.75,0:20:55.91,Main,Kumashi,0,0,0,,乂洛娜大人...！
Dialogue: 0,0:21:02.55,0:21:05.53,Main,Usopp,0,0,0,,一個布偶竟然有如此可怕的力量！
Dialogue: 0,0:21:06.55,0:21:07.56,Main,Usopp,0,0,0,,接招吧！
Dialogue: 0,0:21:07.56,0:21:08.88,Main,Usopp,0,0,0,,{\fad(0,150)}必殺...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:08.88,0:21:10.08,Main,Usopp,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)}火焰球！
Dialogue: 0,0:21:13.90,0:21:14.83,Main,Usopp,0,0,0,,有效了！
Dialogue: 0,0:21:15.77,0:21:17.99,Main,Usopp,0,0,0,,殭屍終究是殭屍！
Dialogue: 0,0:21:17.99,0:21:25.10,Main,Usopp,0,0,0,,現在，用這個油，我來使出\N「你不要靠過來之術」！
Dialogue: 0,0:21:25.96,0:21:26.97,Main,Bearsy,0,0,0,,什麼...？
Dialogue: 0,0:21:28.16,0:21:29.26,Main,Usopp,0,0,0,,笨熊！
Dialogue: 0,0:21:29.26,0:21:30.16,Main,Usopp,0,0,0,,你現在抓不到我了！
Dialogue: 0,0:21:31.79,0:21:33.79,Main,Usopp,0,0,0,,現在沒有任何東西擋我的路了。
Dialogue: 0,0:21:33.79,0:21:35.54,Main,Usopp,0,0,0,,你現在明白我的力量了吧？
Dialogue: 0,0:21:38.94,0:21:45.60,Main,Usopp,0,0,0,,現在嘛，有個比我弱的虛空女必須受到教訓。
Dialogue: 0,0:21:46.47,0:21:48.21,Main,Usopp,0,0,0,,她跑哪去了？
Dialogue: 0,0:21:48.21,0:21:50.74,Main,Perona,0,0,0,,這裡，消極鼻子。
Dialogue: 0,0:21:51.15,0:21:53.41,Main,Usopp,0,0,0,,也許在窗戶外面...？
Dialogue: 0,0:21:53.41,0:21:56.05,Main,Usopp,0,0,0,,不過，那不可能...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:56.05,0:21:58.17,Main,Usopp,0,0,0,,我們在相當高的地-
Dialogue: 0,0:22:02.50,0:22:04.10,Main,Usopp,0,0,0,,你、你...！
Dialogue: 0,0:22:04.10,0:22:06.18,Main,Usopp,0,0,0,,你怎麼能飛？！
Dialogue: 0,0:22:06.18,0:22:08.25,Main,Usopp,0,0,0,,你應該只能操控幽靈才對！
Dialogue: 0,0:22:08.25,0:22:11.60,Main,Usopp,0,0,0,,你、你真正的能力到底是什麼？！
Dialogue: 0,0:22:12.83,0:22:17.86,Main,Perona,0,0,0,,不要小看幽靈公主，笨蛋。
Dialogue: 0,0:22:17.86,0:22:20.95,Main,Perona,0,0,0,,我剛想到一個辦法來對付你。
Dialogue: 0,0:22:20.95,0:22:24.73,Main,Perona,0,0,0,,收拾完你之後，解決剩下的海賊就不成問題了。
Dialogue: 0,0:22:27.90,0:22:29.57,Main,Usopp,0,0,0,,等一下！
Dialogue: 0,0:22:29.57,0:22:34.51,Main,Usopp,0,0,0,,我對那句話... 有不好的預感！
Comment: 0,0:00:00.03,0:00:00.03,Main,,0,0,0,,

